<h1>1. A fifteen-turn live QuoteGraph replay</h1>
<p>Read this first. This is a complete passing provider-backed run with <code>QUOTE_GRAPH_CURRENT_DATE</code> frozen to <code>2027-06-01</code>. The model wording may vary; catalog resolution, coverage policy, calculated premiums, state transitions, and the final completed state are the durable contracts.</p>

<h2 id="run-it-yourself">Run it yourself</h2>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd ezgraph-demo
npm run test2:quote-graph</code></pre>
<p>The script sets <code>USE_ENV=1 KEEP_SESSION=1</code>. The test sends all fifteen turns through one retained session, judges each response semantically, and inspects the final node-owned state. Without <code>USE_ENV=1</code> it is skipped; with it, it needs working provider credentials.</p>

<h2 id="captured-live-transcript">Captured live transcript</h2>
<div class="quote-replay">
  <div class="quote-replay__header"><span class="quote-replay__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><a href="https://github.com/picoflowio/ezgraph-demo/blob/main/test/quote-graph/quote-graph.scenario.json">test/quote-graph/quote-graph.scenario.json</a><span>15 turns · passing live E2E</span></div>
  <ol class="quote-replay__list">
  {%- for turn in replay.turns %}
    <li class="quote-replay__turn{% if turn.completed %} quote-replay__turn--completed{% endif %}">
      <p class="quote-replay__meta">{{ loop.index }} · {{ turn.stage }}{% if turn.completed %} · completed{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--you"><span class="quote-replay__who">You</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.user | escape }}</div></div>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--bot"><span class="quote-replay__who">Bot</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.bot | renderTranscriptMarkdown | safe }}</div></div>
    </li>
  {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>

<p>The final turn locks the current calculated tier, creates a quote reference, sets <code>completed: true</code>, and leaves the accepted tier in <code>QuoteNode</code> state.</p>

